1
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Detecting spatial distortion!</font>

2
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:07,110
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What? They're trying to warp here?</font>

3
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:09,010
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Short-distance warp incoming.</font>

4
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,990
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Estimating coordinates.</font>

5
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:13,330
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Aim all cannons at the coordinates,</font>

6
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:16,490
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">and open fire as soon as
 the enemy ship appears.</font>

7
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:19,900
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Warp gate probabilities converging.</font>

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,000
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Captain! The coordinates!</font>

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,250
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What about them?</font>

10
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:25,250
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">They're close! Way too close!</font>

11
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,010
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">No way...</font>

12
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,010
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Are they suicidal?!</font>

13
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It's not a ship!</font>

14
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,010
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It's a mobile knight!</font>

15
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:38,110
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What?!</font>

16
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It can't be...</font>

17
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:42,020
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">That's the Plundering Count
 and his Black Titan!</font>

18
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:44,640
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">All by himself? Open fire!</font>

19
00:01:31,610 --> 00:01:35,920
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Weak, you're too weak! Can you
 at least make this a little interesting?</font>

20
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:38,370
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You weaklings exist to be my prey.</font>

21
00:01:38,370 --> 00:01:41,770
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Fight for your lives and fulfill your purpose!</font>

22
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:45,370
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Master, are you all right?</i></font>

23
00:01:45,370 --> 00:01:48,250
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I am. Impressive as always, Amagi. 
You planned this perfectly.</font>

24
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:51,270
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I got to warp out
 in the best possible position.</font>

25
00:01:51,270 --> 00:01:53,960
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I was right to let you handle the projections.</font>

26
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:56,410
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Your words honor me.</font>

27
00:01:56,410 --> 00:02:00,220
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Now, I've personally set the table.</i></font>

28
00:02:00,540 --> 00:02:02,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Show me what the rest of you can do.</i></font>

29
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,600
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">As you wish, Master.</font>

30
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:07,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Time to have some fun.</i></font>

31
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:10,600
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Attention, all ships.
 Proceed at level-three combat speed.</font>

32
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:13,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Open fire as soon as you enter combat range.</i></font>

33
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:17,860
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>All mobile knights are to mobilize. 
Follow Master Liam's orders.</i></font>

34
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:20,870
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Christiana moving out. Requesting guidance.</font>

35
00:02:21,420 --> 00:02:23,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Detecting gravity waves in the battlefield.</font>

36
00:02:23,890 --> 00:02:25,710
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Warp success rates plummeting.</font>

37
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:28,750
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>It matters not.
 I would risk it all to guard Lord Liam.</i></font>

38
00:02:29,090 --> 00:02:31,520
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Plotting cross-dimensional detour
 around distortion.</font>

39
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,750
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Staggering your warp as much as possible.</font>

40
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Please fight through
 the downturn in probability.</i></font>

41
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,670
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Commencing guidance.</i></font>

42
00:02:39,690 --> 00:02:42,010
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Initiating warp drive sequence!</font>

43
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:49,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Warp!</font>

44
00:03:08,230 --> 00:03:09,760
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You were nothing!</font>

45
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,920
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>You're late, Tia!</i></font>

46
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:13,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm terribly sorry, Lord Liam!</font>

47
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:17,170
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I, Christiana, will get rid of 
these insolent scrubs for you!</font>

48
00:03:17,170 --> 00:03:18,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Don't get the wrong idea.</i></font>

49
00:03:18,730 --> 00:03:22,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm saying I'll get rid of them all
 if you take your sweet time.</font>

50
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I, Christiana,</font>

51
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:26,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">will fight proudly alongside you!</font>

52
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:30,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">The enemy battleships are 
now within firing range.</font>

53
00:03:30,540 --> 00:03:33,560
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Fire all main cannons at 
the enemy battleships.</font>

54
00:03:41,390 --> 00:03:43,070
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Enemy ships destroyed.</font>

55
00:03:46,910 --> 00:03:50,580
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>How do you like the Seventh 
Weapons Factory's battleship?</i></font>

56
00:03:50,580 --> 00:03:53,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>It's got best-in-class 
features and performance.</i></font>

57
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:55,830
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">We're in the middle of a battle. 
Save it for later, Nias.</font>

58
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:59,630
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>But I wanted to hear what you thought already.</i></font>

59
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:05,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>If you like it, you could order 
another hundred... no, 200 ships?</i></font>

60
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:08,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>We would really appreciate your patronage.</i></font>

61
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:10,100
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Ugh, what a pain.</font>

62
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:12,440
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Amagi, place the orders
 and get her out of my face.</font>

63
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,730
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>As you wish.</i></font>

64
00:04:13,730 --> 00:04:16,230
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Thank you for your purchase!</i></font>

65
00:04:16,230 --> 00:04:17,650
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Sheesh.</font>

66
00:04:17,650 --> 00:04:20,230
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Anyway, the fun's just getting started.</font>

67
00:04:25,490 --> 00:04:27,910
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What, is this all you've got?</font>

68
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:30,370
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Don't you have anyone stronger?</font>

69
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:32,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">This is fun! So much fun!</font>

70
00:04:32,540 --> 00:04:36,240
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Nothing beats the moment of 
crushing the weak without mercy!</font>

71
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:38,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It shows me that I am strong—</font>

72
00:04:38,260 --> 00:04:42,290
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">that I stand alone at the summit of evil!</font>

73
00:04:42,290 --> 00:04:47,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You can all kneel before me,
 the Evil Lord Liam!</font>

74
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:52,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Revenge... This is my revenge.</i></font>

75
00:04:52,540 --> 00:04:56,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>All of it, just to exact 
revenge upon my past life!</i></font>

76
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:09,660
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Yeah... My past life?</i></font>

77
00:05:10,450 --> 00:05:13,410
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>It was deplorable and pathetic.</i></font>

78
00:05:26,510 --> 00:05:27,730
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm home.</font>

79
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Welcome home, honey.</font>

80
00:05:30,740 --> 00:05:32,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Thanks, Mika.</font>

81
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Where's Kanami?</font>

82
00:05:34,490 --> 00:05:36,060
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">She's asleep.</font>

83
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:38,290
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">She kept begging for a dog.</font>

84
00:05:38,290 --> 00:05:39,300
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Why a dog?</font>

85
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:41,690
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">She saw a Shiba at her friend's place.</font>

86
00:05:41,690 --> 00:05:43,570
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Now she insists we should get one.</font>

87
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:47,070
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Oh... I don't know if
 we could afford one right now.</font>

88
00:05:51,250 --> 00:05:52,480
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">A dog, huh?</font>

89
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:02,000
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">This is nice. You don't get too many days off.</font>

90
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,140
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I wanted to come see the dogs myself.</font>

91
00:06:04,140 --> 00:06:06,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Wow. Do you want to get one too?</font>

92
00:06:07,110 --> 00:06:10,640
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Nah, I had one before that 
was like family to me.</font>

93
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:13,220
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I still can't bring myself to forget it.</font>

94
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:15,970
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You love with all your heart, huh?</font>

95
00:06:16,370 --> 00:06:19,950
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Besides, having you and 
Kanami in my life is plenty.</font>

96
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:22,610
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And a dog would cause even 
more work for you than we do?</font>

97
00:06:23,710 --> 00:06:25,980
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I mean it'd be another family member to love.</font>

98
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,620
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I have a wife and daughter I love.</i></font>

99
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:34,870
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>With them, I can live happy and fight 
through any and all difficulties...</i></font>

100
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:37,500
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>That's what I thought back then.</i></font>

101
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,250
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I told you to keep me in the damn loop!</font>

102
00:06:41,250 --> 00:06:43,880
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You did, and I did send you
 a message at once.</font>

103
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Well, I didn't get it, you oaf!</font>

104
00:06:46,670 --> 00:06:48,380
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">How are you gonna fix this?!</font>

105
00:06:50,390 --> 00:06:52,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You should know better, Team Lead.</font>

106
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:54,980
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">The chief always hits the club on Thursdays.</font>

107
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:56,770
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">No point waiting on his approval.</font>

108
00:06:56,770 --> 00:06:58,270
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">But still...</font>

109
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,670
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">This guy never learns.</font>

110
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:07,840
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>The company I worked at
 was toxic and exploitative.</i></font>

111
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:10,030
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>My awful boss worked me like a dog,</i></font>

112
00:07:10,030 --> 00:07:12,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>and my subordinates openly mocked me.</i></font>

113
00:07:12,780 --> 00:07:15,280
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>They'd take credit for things I did...</i></font>

114
00:07:16,580 --> 00:07:19,290
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>and blame me for mistakes I didn't make.</i></font>

115
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:29,920
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Even through all that, my family 
gave me the strength to keep going.</i></font>

116
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:36,300
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I ran myself into the ground working,
 and it was all to keep my family happy.</i></font>

117
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:37,300
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>And yet...</i></font>

118
00:07:44,150 --> 00:07:46,150
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font color="#5a878d"><font size="25">Nitta</font></font></font>

119
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,150
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Nitta-kun?</i></font>

120
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:51,310
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>"Senpai, you know the upcoming 
Deluxe Ultra Alloy Majin Gunder?</i></font>

121
00:07:51,310 --> 00:07:55,900
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>It's got 3D naval battle add-ons for 
the first time! It's finally complete!</i></font>

122
00:07:55,900 --> 00:07:58,650
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>You gotta buy it," huh?</i></font>

123
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Nitta-kun never changes. That's great.</i></font>

124
00:08:03,210 --> 00:08:06,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>He really does love this stuff.</i></font>

125
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:13,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Is this the right place?</i></font>

126
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:13,680
<font size="20" color="#000000"><b><font size="10"><font color="#40716f">Cafe</font></font></b></font>

127
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:13,680
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font color="#689da0"><font size="15">3 mins
 slower</font></font></font>

128
00:08:15,730 --> 00:08:18,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I'm not familiar with this area.</i></font>

129
00:08:24,180 --> 00:08:25,440
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Mika?</i></font>

130
00:08:27,440 --> 00:08:30,940
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Isn't she supposed to take Kanami 
to her sports club today?</i></font>

131
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:37,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Wait, who's that guy?</i></font>

132
00:08:38,670 --> 00:08:39,950
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm home.</font>

133
00:08:39,950 --> 00:08:41,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Welcome back.</font>

134
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:43,490
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You're home early.</font>

135
00:08:43,490 --> 00:08:44,460
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yeah.</font>

136
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,710
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Let me warm up your dinner for you.</font>

137
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:50,340
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">How was today?</font>

138
00:08:50,790 --> 00:08:52,670
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What do you mean?</font>

139
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:55,220
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami's sports club.</font>

140
00:08:55,220 --> 00:08:58,970
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami won a sword fighting match today.</font>

141
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,930
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Right, Kanami?</font>

142
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:01,970
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yep!</font>

143
00:09:01,970 --> 00:09:03,350
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Hi-yah!</font>

144
00:09:03,350 --> 00:09:04,990
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Whoa!</font>

145
00:09:04,990 --> 00:09:08,730
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You won, huh? I'm proud of ya, Kanami.</font>

146
00:09:13,210 --> 00:09:15,860
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Hey, Mika. Today...</font>

147
00:09:16,270 --> 00:09:17,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What?</font>

148
00:09:18,650 --> 00:09:20,490
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Never mind. It's nothing.</font>

149
00:09:20,490 --> 00:09:22,450
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Come on. Don't be weird.</font>

150
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Yeah, it's nothing.</i></font>

151
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:28,230
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I just misunderstood.</i></font>

152
00:09:28,230 --> 00:09:31,430
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Mika would never be unfaithful.</i></font>

153
00:09:31,430 --> 00:09:32,250
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Yeah.</i></font>

154
00:09:32,610 --> 00:09:34,030
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Not Mika, of all people...</i></font>

155
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,760
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Not again.</font>

156
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:38,450
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What's wrong?</font>

157
00:09:38,450 --> 00:09:41,420
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I can't put the PC to sleep. 
I gotta step out, too.</font>

158
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:43,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Guess you'll have to save 
your work and shut it down.</font>

159
00:09:44,770 --> 00:09:46,520
<font size="20" color="#000000"><b><font color="#c6d9dd">Shut down</font></b></font>

160
00:09:44,770 --> 00:09:46,520
<font size="20" color="#000000"><b><font color="#c6d9dd">Reboot</font></b></font>

161
00:10:00,610 --> 00:10:01,410
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yeah, that's right.</font>

162
00:10:01,970 --> 00:10:03,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Just got here.</font>

163
00:10:04,920 --> 00:10:08,040
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yeah, I'm with Kanami. Where are you?</font>

164
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,040
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I see him over there!</font>

165
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,990
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I see you now. Let's go, Kanami.</font>

166
00:10:13,990 --> 00:10:16,140
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yeah... Papa!</font>

167
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:30,100
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Why did she call another man "Papa"?</i></font>

168
00:10:30,100 --> 00:10:34,190
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>No... It can't be.
 That must've been a friend.</i></font>

169
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:39,480
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>A friend who's playing her father 
because I'm always too busy with work.</i></font>

170
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Yeah, that's gotta be it.</i></font>

171
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:43,700
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What are you slacking off for?</font>

172
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,910
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm sorry. My PC's just acting up.</font>

173
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:50,770
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It takes a while to wake up from sleep.</font>

174
00:10:50,770 --> 00:10:52,640
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Then don't put it to sleep.</font>

175
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:55,520
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">But I have to when I go on break
 for security reasons.</font>

176
00:10:55,520 --> 00:10:57,090
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Then don't go on break.</font>

177
00:10:58,320 --> 00:11:00,110
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Just hurry up and get to it.</font>

178
00:11:00,110 --> 00:11:01,090
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Right.</font>

179
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,470
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font color="#afccdb">Mika</font></font>

180
00:11:06,030 --> 00:11:08,230
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Sorry, Mika, I'm still working.</font>

181
00:11:08,230 --> 00:11:10,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Bad news! Kanami's been in an accident!</i></font>

182
00:11:10,260 --> 00:11:11,480
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami?!</font>

183
00:11:16,130 --> 00:11:16,980
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">How is she?</font>

184
00:11:16,980 --> 00:11:20,490
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font size="8"><b><font color="#d1cdc8">Operating</font></b></font></font>

185
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:18,970
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">In surgery...</font>

186
00:11:20,890 --> 00:11:22,990
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Are you Kanami-chan's parents?</font>

187
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:24,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yes.</font>

188
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">She needs a transfusion.</font>

189
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:27,110
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Can you donate your blood?</font>

190
00:11:27,110 --> 00:11:27,920
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Of course!</font>

191
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,750
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What are your blood types?</font>

192
00:11:30,090 --> 00:11:32,860
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm AB-positive.</font>

193
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:35,630
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm O-positive.</font>

194
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:38,060
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Ma'am, if you would.</font>

195
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:40,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What about me?</font>

196
00:11:40,830 --> 00:11:44,640
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami-chan's an O, so it has to be her.</font>

197
00:11:52,020 --> 00:11:55,520
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font size="15"><font color="#384252"><b>Mother's Blood Type</b></font></font></font>

198
00:11:52,020 --> 00:11:55,520
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font size="15"><font color="#163a40"><b>Father's Blood Type</b></font></font></font>

199
00:11:52,530 --> 00:11:55,590
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Why the hell is Kanami an O?</i></font>

200
00:11:57,280 --> 00:11:58,650
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Is the father...</i></font>

201
00:12:00,510 --> 00:12:02,400
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What is the meaning of this?!</font>

202
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,590
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Who's the father?</font>

203
00:12:04,590 --> 00:12:06,620
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Is Kanami not my child?!</font>

204
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,620
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Say something, damn it!</font>

205
00:12:09,830 --> 00:12:13,120
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What are you talking about? 
It's too late for all this.</font>

206
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:15,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Too late, my foot!</font>

207
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:17,630
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I tried so hard not to ask!</font>

208
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:19,500
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You seem to be misunderstanding something.</font>

209
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What?</font>

210
00:12:20,510 --> 00:12:23,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I was the one trying hard not to lash out.</font>

211
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:26,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You don't care one bit about our family.</font>

212
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:29,870
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You work overtime every day 
and even go on weekends.</font>

213
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:32,640
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You only come here to sleep.
 No time to even have a conversation.</font>

214
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:35,850
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You may as well not exist in this home.</font>

215
00:12:35,850 --> 00:12:38,400
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What do you expect? It's my job.</font>

216
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:39,650
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And what good is this job?</font>

217
00:12:40,010 --> 00:12:41,280
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What are you...</font>

218
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:43,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You can't climb the ladder,</font>

219
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:45,770
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">you don't get any raises,</font>

220
00:12:45,770 --> 00:12:48,960
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">you get pennies for bonuses, 
and we hardly have savings.</font>

221
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,840
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami needs a good quality education,</font>

222
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:53,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">and we can't give her one with our finances.</font>

223
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:55,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">So don't you act like 
your job means anything!</font>

224
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:56,540
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Wha...</font>

225
00:12:56,540 --> 00:13:00,800
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You promised me happiness 
if I married you, remember?</font>

226
00:13:01,380 --> 00:13:03,430
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Well, it's been more than ten years.</font>

227
00:13:03,430 --> 00:13:06,820
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">How much time in those ten-plus years 
have you graced me with your presence?</font>

228
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:07,930
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Well...</font>

229
00:13:07,930 --> 00:13:10,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">While you were never here,</font>

230
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:14,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I did the housework, raised a child,</font>

231
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,500
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">and lived basically all by myself!</font>

232
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:17,520
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><font color="#3c4045">Hngh</font></font></font>

233
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:17,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">But that's your...</font>

234
00:13:17,890 --> 00:13:19,940
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yeah, that's my job!</font>

235
00:13:20,490 --> 00:13:23,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And all those times have been 
Kanami's and mine alone!</font>

236
00:13:23,200 --> 00:13:24,950
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And this is Kanami's and my life,</font>

237
00:13:25,290 --> 00:13:27,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">just the two of us!</font>

238
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:30,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You're not a part of this home.</font>

239
00:13:32,110 --> 00:13:33,620
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm going to take Kanami and leave.</font>

240
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:35,210
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And go where?</font>

241
00:13:35,210 --> 00:13:38,460
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font face="Comic Sans MS"><font size="15"><font color="#e0e0ec">Kanami</font></font></font></font>

242
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:37,610
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Do you have to ask?</font>

243
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:38,460
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami.</font>

244
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:40,550
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Let's go to Papa.</font>

245
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:41,710
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Wait!</font>

246
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Move.</font>

247
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,470
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I said wait!</font>

248
00:13:44,470 --> 00:13:45,450
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And I said move.</font>

249
00:13:45,450 --> 00:13:46,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Wait just a damn minute!</font>

250
00:13:46,510 --> 00:13:47,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Move!</font>

251
00:13:48,650 --> 00:13:51,070
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You think you can just 
leave and that'll be that?</font>

252
00:13:51,070 --> 00:13:52,850
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Oh, that will be that.</font>

253
00:13:52,850 --> 00:13:55,600
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What do you care about Kanami?</font>

254
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:57,480
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I've raised her all this time!</font>

255
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:59,020
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">How could I not care?!</font>

256
00:13:59,020 --> 00:14:00,610
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm the one who raised her.</font>

257
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You were never around.</font>

258
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:05,210
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I was! I was right here!</font>

259
00:14:05,210 --> 00:14:06,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Right, Kanami?</font>

260
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Dad was here with you, right?!</font>

261
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:10,870
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You wanna stay here with Dad, right?!</font>

262
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:13,060
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I...</font>

263
00:14:14,450 --> 00:14:16,580
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I like the other Papa better.</font>

264
00:14:19,290 --> 00:14:20,750
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Why?</i></font>

265
00:14:21,020 --> 00:14:23,740
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Why is this happening to me?</i></font>

266
00:14:23,740 --> 00:14:24,560
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Hey!</font>

267
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,130
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yes?</font>

268
00:14:26,970 --> 00:14:29,150
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Explain this bank transfer.</font>

269
00:14:29,150 --> 00:14:30,140
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Huh?</font>

270
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What is this?</font>

271
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,930
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">That's what I'm asking you!</font>

272
00:14:33,930 --> 00:14:36,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Why'd you send some random 
account 50 million yen?!</font>

273
00:14:36,890 --> 00:14:38,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I don't recall doing that.</font>

274
00:14:38,890 --> 00:14:42,600
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Look, the logs say it was from your PC!</font>

275
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,020
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Huh?</font>

276
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,770
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">That can't be right.</font>

277
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:56,290
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Seriously?</font>

278
00:15:05,050 --> 00:15:10,550
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I was deemed to have embezzled 
company money and fired on the spot.</i></font>

279
00:15:11,370 --> 00:15:15,060
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Mika used that as an excuse 
to file for divorce,</i></font>

280
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:17,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>get full custody of Kanami,</i></font>

281
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:20,060
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>and demand child support from me.</i></font>

282
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:22,310
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What are you doing, newbie?!</font>

283
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,430
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I-I'm sorry!</font>

284
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:30,800
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>The company and I settled on 
me paying back the money lost.</i></font>

285
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I avoided getting sued, but...</i></font>

286
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:48,340
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">When am I ever gonna pay all that back?</font>

287
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:52,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Nitta-kun?</i></font>

288
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:52,720
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font size="8"><font color="#859195">Message</font></font></font>

289
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:52,720
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font size="10"><font color="#4e6c69">Nitta</font></font></font>

290
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>"Senpai!</i></font>

291
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:56,510
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>The upcoming 8K remaster box set of <i>RoboKaiser</i></i></font>

292
00:15:56,510 --> 00:16:00,890
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>includes the legendary unaired 12th 
episode. I preordered it immediately."</i></font>

293
00:16:00,890 --> 00:16:02,730
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Oh, they're releasing episode 12, huh?</i></font>

294
00:16:03,150 --> 00:16:04,140
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>That's awesome.</i></font>

295
00:16:04,140 --> 00:16:06,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I've always wanted to watch it.</i></font>

296
00:16:06,180 --> 00:16:07,730
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Let's watch it together once you get it.</i></font>

297
00:16:10,740 --> 00:16:13,240
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font color="#616e71">Let's watch it together once you get it.</font></font>

298
00:16:20,990 --> 00:16:22,750
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>If I work hard,</i></font>

299
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:25,250
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I'm sure things will get better.</i></font>

300
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:28,580
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>And I'll get to see Kanami again, too.</i></font>

301
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:33,760
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I know she's not even my child...</i></font>

302
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:42,710
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>But still, I believe that my 
sacrifices will be rewarded.</i></font>

303
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,870
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I can't afford treatment.</i></font>

304
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:58,090
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I don't have insurance.</i></font>

305
00:16:58,560 --> 00:17:00,560
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I have no way to borrow money,</i></font>

306
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:02,560
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>and even if I found a way, 
I couldn't pay it back.</i></font>

307
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:10,130
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Don't people say that your old pets come 
pick you up when you're about to die?</i></font>

308
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:13,670
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I wonder if it'll come for me.</i></font>

309
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,100
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>What the...?</i></font>

310
00:17:21,390 --> 00:17:22,470
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>A dream?</i></font>

311
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:26,190
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>What are you doing with my PC?</i></font>

312
00:17:26,190 --> 00:17:28,690
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font color="#5a6a8b">Return</font></font>

313
00:17:26,190 --> 00:17:28,690
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font color="#5a6a8b">Send</font></font>

314
00:17:26,740 --> 00:17:28,690
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Sending 50 million yen?</i></font>

315
00:17:30,170 --> 00:17:31,190
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>No way...</i></font>

316
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:34,120
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>The chief did it?</i></font>

317
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:41,900
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>What's with her, dining at an 
expensive restaurant and all?</i></font>

318
00:17:44,770 --> 00:17:46,210
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>The man she had an affair with,</i></font>

319
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:48,210
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Kanami's father...</i></font>

320
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:50,710
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>was the chief?!</i></font>

321
00:17:51,210 --> 00:17:53,430
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You're an awful woman.</font>

322
00:17:53,430 --> 00:17:55,520
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You foist all that debt 
onto your ex-husband,</font>

323
00:17:55,520 --> 00:17:57,860
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">and you make him pay child support too.</font>

324
00:17:57,860 --> 00:17:59,650
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">He got to marry and live with me.</font>

325
00:17:59,650 --> 00:18:01,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It's the least he could do.</font>

326
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:05,570
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Let him make that money back. 
It's all he's good for.</font>

327
00:18:05,570 --> 00:18:06,990
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">What a piece of work.</font>

328
00:18:06,990 --> 00:18:09,480
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Kanami's not even his child.</font>

329
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:12,650
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I only wanted superior genes.</font>

330
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:14,980
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I didn't need a kid with a man like him.</font>

331
00:18:14,980 --> 00:18:17,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Whoo, you're a scary one.</font>

332
00:18:17,990 --> 00:18:20,990
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>What the hell? What the hell is all this?</i></font>

333
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:25,430
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Am I dreaming? Please tell me 
this is all just a bad dream...</i></font>

334
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,100
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Nay, this is reality.</font>

335
00:18:29,750 --> 00:18:32,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It's the truth, and nothing but the truth.</font>

336
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,370
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You lived such a hard life,</font>

337
00:18:34,370 --> 00:18:37,200
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">working yourself to the bone...</font>

338
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:40,260
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Yet all this time, it was nothing but lies!</font>

339
00:18:40,260 --> 00:18:44,140
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Can they really get away with such evil?</font>

340
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:49,140
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>No... I can't let them get away with it!</i></font>

341
00:18:49,470 --> 00:18:53,400
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'll get my revenge on them.</font>

342
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:56,900
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'll get them, I swear!</font>

343
00:18:56,900 --> 00:19:00,130
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Ah, such purity of emotion.</font>

344
00:19:00,130 --> 00:19:02,700
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Rage, hatred, and sorrow!</font>

345
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:05,160
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It's so tasty!</font>

346
00:19:05,550 --> 00:19:07,790
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Who the hell are you?</font>

347
00:19:07,790 --> 00:19:11,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I have taken an interest in you
 because you're a good man.</font>

348
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:12,670
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Screw that.</font>

349
00:19:12,670 --> 00:19:15,180
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Look what living like a good man has gotten me.</font>

350
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:19,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I should've said screw everyone else and 
sought my own happiness above all else.</font>

351
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:21,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Good karma isn't worth shit.</font>

352
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,240
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">It's all hogwash.</font>

353
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:26,560
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Wonderful! Truly wonderful!</font>

354
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:28,390
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">If I can have a second life,</font>

355
00:19:28,390 --> 00:19:30,330
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I wanna do whatever the hell I want.</font>

356
00:19:30,330 --> 00:19:35,440
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Hell, I'll live for myself as a villain 
who walks all over everyone else.</font>

357
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:38,310
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Boy, do I have some good news for you.</font>

358
00:19:38,310 --> 00:19:42,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'm here to send you to another life.</font>

359
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:47,450
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">You may call me your guide, if you like.</font>

360
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:50,960
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I've brought you gifts.</font>

361
00:19:51,310 --> 00:19:54,230
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">How would you like to be reincarnated 
in a different world?!</font>

362
00:19:55,740 --> 00:19:57,800
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">A fantasy world with swords and magic.</font>

363
00:19:58,440 --> 00:20:02,010
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">A world like this one, but with superpowers.</font>

364
00:20:02,010 --> 00:20:03,720
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">A period drama!</font>

365
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:05,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">The wild west!</font>

366
00:20:05,320 --> 00:20:06,600
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">The Jurassic era.</font>

367
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:09,600
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I've prepared all kinds of options for you!</font>

368
00:20:10,050 --> 00:20:12,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Reincarnated in another world?</i></font>

369
00:20:12,320 --> 00:20:14,320
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Is this what Nitta-kun was talking about?</i></font>

370
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:16,360
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I thought this only happened in books.</i></font>

371
00:20:17,010 --> 00:20:18,560
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>But it's real?</i></font>

372
00:20:18,560 --> 00:20:22,860
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Now, go ahead and choose 
whatever world you like!</font>

373
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:26,400
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Robots and space battleships?</i></font>

374
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:28,670
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Nitta-kun and I used to 
talk about that...</i></font>

375
00:20:29,370 --> 00:20:31,500
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">And it was fun.</font>

376
00:20:31,500 --> 00:20:34,370
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">We'd kick up a real storm talking about it.</font>

377
00:20:34,660 --> 00:20:39,230
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">A sci-fi fantasy world with both 
advanced science and magic.</font>

378
00:20:39,230 --> 00:20:43,630
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Feudalism lives strong, and the world's 
ruled by royals and their nobles.</font>

379
00:20:43,930 --> 00:20:50,640
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I'll make it so you're born into the 
house of a count who rules a planet.</font>

380
00:20:51,040 --> 00:20:55,020
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">A count? That's pretty high up.</font>

381
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:02,150
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">So you've made your peace?</font>

382
00:21:02,150 --> 00:21:06,030
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">I hope you'll have a good life this time, then!</font>

383
00:21:07,170 --> 00:21:09,910
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I've had enough of living an honest life.</i></font>

384
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:12,150
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>If I'm being born into nobility,</i></font>

385
00:21:12,150 --> 00:21:14,120
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>then screw everyone else,</i></font>

386
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:18,100
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I'll put my happiness first 
and do what I want...</i></font>

387
00:21:18,100 --> 00:21:21,470
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>I'll rule with an iron fist 
and be as evil as I please!</i></font>

388
00:21:22,670 --> 00:21:24,300
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Oh, this is fun!</font>

389
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:27,680
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Bullying the weak just feels so, so good!</font>

390
00:21:33,560 --> 00:21:35,440
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">No... Spare me!</font>

391
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:39,440
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">Give me more... Entertain me more!</font>

392
00:21:41,620 --> 00:21:46,730
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26">{\an8}Entertain your evil lord,
 the great Liam Sera Banfield!</font>

393
00:21:45,820 --> 00:21:48,950
<font size="20" color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman"><b><font size="28"><font color="#08041a">Revenge</font></font></b></font></font>

394
00:22:04,340 --> 00:22:08,720
<font size="20" color="#000000">{\an8}<b><font face="Times New Roman"><font size="32"><font color="#e2081e">I'm the Evil Lord of
 an Intergalactic Empire!</font></font></font></b></font>

395
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:23,960
<font size="20" color="#000000"><b><font face="Times New Roman"><font color="#bebab0"><font size="31">Rebirth</font></font></font></b></font>

396
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:23,350
<font face="Roboto Medium" size="26"><i>Allow me to show you to... "Rebirth."</i></font>

